---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import KeyFacts from '../components/KeyFacts.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
import AuthorBox from '../components/AuthorBox.astro';
import Sources from '../components/Sources.astro';
import { site, rates, lkr } from '../data/site';
import { tours, totalKm } from '../data/tours';
import { service } from '../lib/schema';

const base = Astro.site!;
const usd = (n: number) => `US$${n.toLocaleString('en-US')}`;
const checked = new Date(site.lastUpdated).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' });
const perPerson = (perDay: number, people: number) => usd(Math.round(perDay / people));

const sources = [
  { title: 'Ceylon Route: Hire a private driver in Sri Lanka, cost in 2026', url: 'https://ceylonroute.com/blog/hire-private-driver-sri-lanka-cost-2026/' },
  { title: 'Rediscover Sri Lanka: Hire a private driver in Sri Lanka (2026)', url: 'https://rediscoversrilanka.com/hire-a-private-driver-in-sri-lanka-2026-chauffeur-guide-service/' },
  { title: 'Oura Travel: Cost to hire a driver in Sri Lanka', url: 'https://ouratravel.com/cost-hire-driver-sri-lanka/' },
  { title: 'Central Bank of Sri Lanka: exchange rates', url: 'https://www.cbsl.gov.lk/en/rates-and-indicators/exchange-rates' },
  { title: 'Sunday Times (21 June 2026): Podi Menike runs again from Nanu Oya to Badulla', url: 'https://www.sundaytimes.lk/260621/news/podi-menike-hits-the-tracks-from-nanu-oya-to-badulla-marking-latest-phase-of-restoration-646913.html' },
  { title: 'Newswire (8 Sept 2026): Nanu Oya–Great Western railway repairs to be completed by December', url: 'https://www.newswire.lk/2026/09/08/nanu-oya-great-western-railway-repairs-to-be-completed-by-december/' },
];
---

<Base
  title="How much does a private driver in Sri Lanka cost? (2026)"
  description={`A private driver in Sri Lanka costs ${usd(rates.sedan.perDay)}/day by A/C sedan or ${usd(rates.van.perDay)}/day by van with ${site.name}, all-inclusive. Totals for 7, 10 and 14 days.`}
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Prices', path: '/pricing/' }]}
  schema={[service(base)]}
>
  <h1>How much does a private driver in Sri Lanka cost?</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    A private driver with an air-conditioned sedan costs {usd(rates.sedan.perDay)} per day with {site.name}, or
    {usd(rates.van.perDay)} per day for a van that seats up to 8. The rate includes fuel, highway tolls, parking and the
    driver's meals and room, so a 7-day trip by sedan costs {usd(7 * rates.sedan.perDay)} before hotels and entrance tickets.
  </p>

  <KeyFacts>
    <ul>
      <li>{rates.sedan.label}: {usd(rates.sedan.perDay)} per day ({lkr(rates.sedan.perDay)}).</li>
      <li>{rates.van.label}: {usd(rates.van.perDay)} per day ({lkr(rates.van.perDay)}).</li>
      <li>Typical 2026 market rates: US$55–75 per day for a sedan and US$80–120 for a van.</li>
      <li>Shared between 2 travellers, a sedan works out at {perPerson(rates.sedan.perDay, 2)} per person per day.</li>
      <li>Prices last checked <time datetime={site.lastUpdated}>{checked}</time>; indicative.</li>
    </ul>
  </KeyFacts>

  <h2>What are the day rates for a driver and car?</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <caption>Per vehicle, not per person. LKR at about {site.usdToLkr} per US$ (late September 2026).</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Vehicle</th><th scope="col" class="num">US$ per day</th><th scope="col" class="num">LKR per day</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {Object.values(rates).map((r) => (
          <tr><th scope="row">{r.label}</th><td class="num">{usd(r.perDay)}</td><td class="num">{lkr(r.perDay)}</td></tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    A day is each calendar day the driver is with you, including the arrival and departure days. Single transfers outside a
    tour have fixed prices; see <a href="/guides/airport-transfers/">Colombo airport (CMB) transfer times and prices</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What is included in the price, and what is not?</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Included</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>English-speaking driver-guide for the whole trip</li>
        <li>Air-conditioned sedan or van</li>
        <li>Fuel, highway tolls and parking</li>
        <li>The driver's meals and accommodation</li>
        <li>Child seats on request</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Not included</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Your hotels and meals</li>
        <li>Entrance tickets (Sigiriya, Dambulla, Temple of the Tooth and others)</li>
        <li>Safari jeeps in Yala or Minneriya</li>
        <li>Train tickets</li>
        <li>Tips, which are optional; see <a href="/guides/tipping-and-driver-costs/">tipping and driver costs</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>How much does a 7, 10 or 14-day trip with a driver cost?</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="stack">
      <caption>Driver and vehicle only, for the full itinerary. Hotels, tickets and safaris are extra.</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Itinerary</th>
          <th scope="col" class="num">Days</th>
          <th scope="col" class="num">Distance</th>
          <th scope="col" class="num">Sedan</th>
          <th scope="col" class="num">Van</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {tours.map((t) => (
          <tr>
            <th scope="row"><a href={`/tours/${t.slug}/`}>{t.title}</a></th>
            <td class="num" data-label="Days">{t.days}</td>
            <td class="num" data-label="Distance">~{totalKm(t).toLocaleString('en-US')} km</td>
            <td class="num" data-label="Sedan">{usd(t.days * rates.sedan.perDay)}<br /><span class="muted">{lkr(t.days * rates.sedan.perDay)}</span></td>
            <td class="num" data-label="Van">{usd(t.days * rates.van.perDay)}<br /><span class="muted">{lkr(t.days * rates.van.perDay)}</span></td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>How do these prices compare with other drivers in Sri Lanka?</h2>
  <p>
    Three 2026 driver-hire guides put the going rate at US$55–75 per day for a sedan and US$80–120 for a van, usually
    including fuel, tolls and the driver's food and room. Our rates sit in the lower half of both ranges.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="stack">
      <caption>Market ranges from the guides listed under Sources.</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Vehicle</th><th scope="col" class="num">{site.name}</th><th scope="col" class="num">Typical 2026 market rate</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">Sedan (1–3 travellers)</th><td class="num" data-label={site.name}>{usd(rates.sedan.perDay)}</td><td class="num" data-label="Typical 2026 market rate">US$55–75</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Van (4–8 travellers)</th><td class="num" data-label={site.name}>{usd(rates.van.perDay)}</td><td class="num" data-label="Typical 2026 market rate">US$80–120</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>When comparing quotes, check whether fuel, tolls and the driver's room are included, and whether the rate is per vehicle or per person.</p>

  <h2>Is a driver cheaper than the train or a tuk-tuk?</h2>
  <p>
    Per ticket, no: trains and buses cost far less. But a driver's rate is per vehicle, so it falls quickly per person:
    {perPerson(rates.sedan.perDay, 2)} each per day for 2 travellers in a sedan, or about {perPerson(rates.van.perDay, 6)} each
    for 6 in a van. Tuk-tuks suit short trips around town, not long distances with luggage.
  </p>
  <p>
    The train also covers only part of the route in 2026. After Cyclone Ditwah, the Nanu Oya → Ella → Badulla section
    reopened on 20 June 2026, but the Kandy end of the hill-country line is still being repaired. Our full comparison is in <a href="/guides/driver-vs-train/">private driver vs train vs tuk-tuk in Sri Lanka</a>.
  </p>

  <section class="related">
    <h2>Plan the rest of your trip</h2>
    <ul>
      {tours.map((t) => <li><a href={`/tours/${t.slug}/`}>{t.title}</a></li>)}
      <li><a href="/guides/airport-transfers/">Colombo airport (CMB) transfers: times and prices</a></li>
      <li><a href="/faq/">Frequently asked questions about hiring a driver</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <Cta />
  <AuthorBox />
  <Sources items={sources} />
</Base>
